    <string name="settings_privacy">Privacy</string>
    <string name="settings_privacy_body">eikon works entirely on your device. It has no internet permission, no account and no analytics, and its data is excluded from Android backups.\n\nYour photos are never copied: eikon keeps a local index with file details (name, date, size, folder) so the library opens instantly. Deleting the app deletes the index.</string>
